{"suttaId":"tha-ap33","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[3118,3167],"vripara":"1"},"segments":{"tha-ap33:0.3":"Kuṇḍadhānattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap33:1.1":"“Sattāhaṃ paṭisallīnaṃ, sayambhuṃ aggapuggalaṃ;","tha-ap33:1.3":"Pasannacitto sumano, buddhaseṭṭhaṃ upaṭṭhahiṃ.","tha-ap33:2.1":"“Vuṭṭhitaṃ kālamaññāya, padumuttaraṃ mahāmuniṃ;","tha-ap33:2.3":"Mahantiṃ kadalīkaṇṇiṃ, gahetvā upagacchahaṃ.","tha-ap33:3.1":"“Paṭiggahetvā [paṭiggahesi (syā. ka.)] bhagavā, sabbaññū [taṃ phalaṃ (sī.)] lokanāyako;","tha-ap33:3.3":"Mama cittaṃ pasādento, paribhuñji mahāmuni.","tha-ap33:4.1":"“Paribhuñjitvā sambuddho, satthavāho anuttaro;","tha-ap33:4.3":"Sakāsane nisīditvā, imā gāthā abhāsatha.","tha-ap33:5.1":"“‘Ye ca santi samitāro [ye vasanti sametāro (sī.)], yakkhā imamhi pabbate;","tha-ap33:5.3":"Araññe bhūtabhabyāni [bhūtagaṇā sabbe (syā.)], suṇantu vacanaṃ mama’.","tha-ap33:6.1":"“Yo so buddhaṃ upaṭṭhāsi, migarājaṃva kesariṃ [migarājāva kesarī (sī.)];","tha-ap33:6.3":"Tamahaṃ kittayissāmi, suṇātha mama bhāsato.","tha-ap33:7.1":"“‘Ekādasañcakkhattuṃ, so [soyamekādasakkhattuṃ (sī.)] devarājā bhavissati;","tha-ap33:7.3":"Catutiṃsatikkhattuñca, cakkavattī bhavissati.","tha-ap33:8.1":"“‘Kappasatasahassamhi, okkākakulasambhavo;","tha-ap33:8.3":"Gotamo nāma gottena, satthā loke bhavissati.","tha-ap33:9.1":"“‘Akkositvāna samaṇe, sīlavante anāsave;","tha-ap33:9.3":"Pāpakammavipākena, nāmadheyyaṃ labhissati [bhavissati (ka.)].","tha-ap33:10.1":"“‘Tassa dhammesu dāyādo, oraso dhammanimmito;","tha-ap33:10.3":"Kuṇḍadhānoti nāmena, sāvako so bhavissati’.","tha-ap33:11.1":"“Pavivekamanuyutto, jhāyī jhānarato ahaṃ;","tha-ap33:11.3":"Tosayitvāna satthāraṃ, viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap33:12.1":"“Sāvakehi [sāvakaggehi (sī.)] parivuto, bhikkhusaṅghapurakkhato;","tha-ap33:12.3":"Bhikkhusaṅghe nisīditvā, salākaṃ gāhayī jino.","tha-ap33:13.1":"“Ekaṃsaṃ cīvaraṃ katvā, vanditvā lokanāyakaṃ;","tha-ap33:13.3":"Vadataṃ varassa purato, paṭhamaṃ aggahesahaṃ.","tha-ap33:14.1":"“Tena kammena bhagavā, dasasahassīkampako;","tha-ap33:14.3":"Bhikkhusaṅghe nisīditvā, aggaṭṭhāne ṭhapesi maṃ.","tha-ap33:15.1":"“Vīriyaṃ me dhuradhorayhaṃ, yogakkhemādhivāhanaṃ;","tha-ap33:15.3":"Dhāremi antimaṃ dehaṃ, sammāsambuddhasāsane.","tha-ap33:16.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso, vimokkhāpi ca aṭṭhime;","tha-ap33:16.3":"Chaḷabhiññā sacchikatā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap33:17.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā kuṇḍadhāno thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap33:18.1":"Kuṇḍadhānattherassāpadānaṃ paṭhamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2408,"to":2408,"paras":[{"para":2408,"vripara":"1","refs":["tha-ap33:1"],"lines":["Evaṃ so pūritapuññasambhārānurūpena arahā hutvā pattaetadaggaṭṭhāno attano pubbakammaṃ saritvā somanassavasena pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>sattāhaṃ paṭisallīnan</b>tiādimāha.","Tattha satthāhaṃ sattadivasaṃ nirodhasamāpattivihārena paṭisallīnaṃ vivekabhūtanti attho.","Sesaṃ uttānatthamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap33:1"],["tha-ap33:1"],["tha-ap33:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap33:1.1","sattāhaṃ paṭisallīnaṃ",0,0]]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
